OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe cause of fire at
OL,4,AGlasgow affordable homes tenement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cause of a fire that broke out at a
OL,7,Fhousing association tenement under
OL,8,Frefurbishment in Glasgow is under
OL,9,Finvestigation, police have said.
OL,11,FThe building in Stonyhurst Street,
OL,12,FPossilpark - which was derelict for 20
OL,13,Fyears - had received #3m to be
OL,14,Frenovated as affordable homes.
OL,16,FGlasgow MSP Paul Sweeney claimed the
OL,17,Fblaze was started deliberately on
OL,18,FSunday following online
OL,19,F"disinformation" that the flats would
OL,20,Fbe used for asylum seekers.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
